WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.348
BEE: Welcome to the bug disco! Shoes required.

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:07.399
SPIDER: Eight shoes, please.

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:09.551
BEE: Six. Best I can do.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.491
BEE: One. Two. Three. Four. Five. Six.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.204
SPIDER: Great! Now, what about these two?

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.759
ROBOT: Error! Too many feet!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.066
NARRATOR: Insects, like bees, have six legs.

00:00:31.786 --> 00:00:35.948
NARRATOR: Spiders have eight legs. They are arachnids, not insects.

00:00:38.786 --> 00:00:41.261
BEE: I can fly! I do not need shoes!

00:00:43.786 --> 00:00:45.352
SPIDER: Then I can have yours!

00:00:48.286 --> 00:00:49.607
BEE: You took my cake!

00:00:50.027 --> 00:00:51.584
SPIDER: No. I am sharing!

00:00:54.286 --> 00:00:57.348
NARRATOR: Six legs. Eight legs. Everyone can dance!

00:00:59.786 --> 00:01:02.396
NARRATOR: How many legs does a spider have?

00:01:05.786 --> 00:01:08.775
SPIDER: Eight legs. And one very happy spider!
